


 Minutes of the FIGGY BAR RT Conference.

   Open FIGGY BAR of 28 Dec 1989. Items discussed include: CSI dropping Amiga
   support, February SIGForth ACM Dallas bash, E. Rather in conf 18 Jan, RTX
   contest kits go out, parallel desk-top Forth for <$800 !, Tiles, cf83 
   upgrade, X3/J14 in San Diego, MIMD, SIMD, Parallel Distributed Processing.

Date: 12/28/89   Time: 22:32EST
